<title>UK: Commerzbank sets 1.0 bln Czech crown bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets 1.0 bln Czech crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager WoodCommerz.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.50     MATURITY    10.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.94    PAY DATE    10.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2     DENOMS (K) 25-250-1M SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/CZ</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
